  "job_A31_20251003_114216": {
    "text": "W\u00e6s on ealddagum Israheala folc \u00feurh Moysen, m\u00e6rne lareow, anlyht and gelared, swa hine lifes frea,\n\u00dea se leoda fruma larum fyligde heofena heahcyninges, and \u00fea h\u00e6le\u00fe samod, swa hie on leodscipe\nFeala is m\u00e6gena \u00fee sio m\u00e6re \u00feeod on \u00feam herescype heold and worhte, \u00feendan hie lifes frean lufian\nWe \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrdon h\u00e6le\u00fea m\u00e6nige on bocstafum breman and writan, \u00fe\u00e6t hie f\u00e6stenu feower heoldon\nAc arisan ongan rices ealdor of byrgenne, bl\u00e6da gefylled, and mid heofenwarum ham gesohte, eard mid\nNa \u00fe\u00e6r in cume\u00f0 atele gefylled, womme gewesed, ac scal on wyrd sceacan.\nNu we herian sceolan her for life deorne d\u00e6dfruman, and him geara gerim \u00e6lmesd\u00e6dum ure gefyllan,\nWe \u00fe\u00e6t forme sceolan f\u00e6sten heowan on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6restan wucan lengtenes, on \u00feam mon\u00fee \u00fee man\nOfer \u00fea Eastertid o\u00feer f\u00e6sten ys to bremenne Brytena leodum mid gelicum lofe, \u00fee gelesen hafa\u00f0 on\n\u00d0onne is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00ferydde \u00feinga gehwelces f\u00e6sten on foldan fyra bearnum dihte gelicum on \u00feam deoran hofe\nWe \u00fe\u00e6t feor\u00fee sceolen f\u00e6sten gel\u00e6stan on \u00fe\u00e6re wucan \u00fee bi\u00f0 \u00e6rur full dryhtnes gebyrde, and we mid\nOn \u00feissum f\u00e6stenum is se feor\u00fea d\u00e6g and sixta samod seofo\u00fea getinge to gel\u00e6stanne lifes ealdre and\nGif \u00fee \u00feonne secgan su\u00fean cymene bryttan Franca, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu gebann sceole her on eor\u00fean \u00e6nig healdan,\n\u00deus he gesette sylf ond dyhte \u00fea \u00feenunga, \u00feeodlareow, f\u00e6stendtida; we \u00feam for\u00fe nu gyt geond Engla\nSwa he \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m setle sylfa gedemde, sancte Petres preostas sy\u00fe\u00fean lange lifes tyd leordun \u00fe\u00e6t sylfe,\nEac we feowertig daga f\u00e6sten healden \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6riste ures dryhtnes, \u00fe\u00e6t nu lengtentid leoda nemna\u00f0,\nHim \u00fe\u00e6r gesealde sylfe dryhten bremne boca cr\u00e6ft, b\u00e6le behl\u00e6ned, of his haligan handa gescrifene,\nEft Helias, eorl se m\u00e6ra, him on westene wiste ge\u00feigede, \u00fe\u00e6r him symbelbread somod mid w\u00e6tere\nUton \u00fe\u00e6t gerine rihte gehicgan, \u00fe\u00e6t se m\u00e6ra \u00feegen mihta ne h\u00e6fde to astigenne st\u00e6ppon on ypplen\nWe sint on westene wuldres blisse on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6nete ealra gefeana; nu is helpes tid, halig dryhten, hu we\nSint for englas geteald eor\u00febugendum \u00fea \u00fee dryhtnes word d\u00e6dum l\u00e6ra\u00f0.\nWe \u00fea andlifene ofstum \u00feycgen and \u00feone deoran wist, dryhtnes lare; uton f\u00e6stan swa fyrene d\u00e6dum\nIs to hicganne hu se halga gewat of \u00feissum wangstede wuldres neosian; hine fyren scryd feower\nNu w\u00e6s \u00e6t nehstan \u00fe\u00e6t us nergend Crist, halig heofenes weord, heolp and l\u00e6rde.\nHe hine dyppan let deorum \u00feweale, fulwihtes b\u00e6\u00f0e, fyrena bed\u00e6led, and he feowertig daga firsude\nHine costude \u00fe\u00e6r Cristes gewinna on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6nete eald and fr\u00e6te, geseah m\u00e6rne frean mannum gelicne\nN\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6s leahtra nan, ac on hinder gewat hearmes brytta, and \u00fe\u00e6r englas hyra ealdor sohtan.\nHigesynnig man, gyf \u00fee susla weard costian durre, \u00feonne he Crist dyde, wereda wulderfrean, womma\nH\u00e6bbe we nu gemearcod hu \u00fea m\u00e6ran iu feowertig daga f\u00e6sten hewdon, and we bebeoda\u00f0 \u00feurh beorn\nSceolan sacerdas singan m\u00e6ssan, d\u00e6ghwamlice dryhten biddan on \u00feam f\u00e6stenne \u00fe\u00e6t he freond wese\n\u00deonne is \u00feearf micel \u00feeoda m\u00e6nium \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea sacerdos sylfe ne gyltan, ne on leahtrum hiora ligegen to\nHwa m\u00e6g \u00feyngian \u00fereale hwilcum wi\u00fe his arwesan, gyf he him \u00e6rur h\u00e6f\u00f0 bitere onbolgen, and \u00fe\u00e6s\nGyf se sacerd hine sylfne ne cunne \u00feurh dryhtnes ege duge\u00feum healdan, nu \u00fea, folces mann, fyrna ne\nAc ic secgan m\u00e6g, sorgum hremig, hu \u00fea sacerdas sace niwia\u00f0, d\u00e6ghwamlice dryhten gremia\u00f0 and\nSona hie on mergan m\u00e6ssan synga\u00f0 and for\u00feegide, \u00feurste geb\u00e6ded, \u00e6fter t\u00e6ppere teo\u00fe geond str\u00e6ta.\nHw\u00e6t.\nHi leaslice leogan ongynna\u00f0 and \u00feone t\u00e6ppere tyhta\u00fe gelome, secga\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he synleas syllan mote\nHi \u00feonne sittende sadian aginna\u00f0, sinne sema\u00f0, sylla\u00f0 gelome, cwe\u00f0a\u00f0 goddlife gumena gehwilcum",
